theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "• A / D or Left / Right: Move fighter & air control
• Space: Jump (Double-tap in air for air jump)
• S + Space: Drop through one-way platform
• J: Melee Attack (deals 15 dmg, adds 8% knockback, costs 18 stamina)
• Esc: Pause Game

ARENA MECHANICS:
• Knockback % increases after every hit taken!
• Higher Knockback = farther launch distance!
• Bounce Platforms below: Launch you back up into the arena!
• Periodic Heal: Golden tick restores +15 HP every 30s!"

